# Large / secret VM artifacts must never be committed.
# The scripts regenerate everything from scratch. The default cache dir is the
# repo-root .vmcache/ (ignored via the repo-root .gitignore); these patterns
# additionally cover artifacts if the cache is ever pointed under hack/vm/.
*.img
*.qcow2
*.iso
*.pid
*.log
*.sock
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
user-data
meta-data
